==German==

===Etymology===
Teenage slang. More {{lit|to get on someone's cookie|nocap=1}}. The original reference is {{unk|de|uncertain}}, but is probably a playful substitution of {{m|de|Keks}} for several other words which produce the same result. This is possibly related to other idioms such as {{m|de|einen weichen Keks haben}} and {{m|de|einen am Keks haben}}.

